OL,3,GNEWSACharity calls for 'co-ordinated'
OL,4,Ahelp for young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that mentors young people in
OL,7,Fthe West Midlands says a co-ordinated,
OL,8,Fpreventative approach is needed to
OL,9,Faddress the rising number of young
OL,10,Fpeople who are "Neet".
OL,12,FNearly one million 16-24 year-olds in
OL,13,Fthe UK are not currently in education,
OL,14,Femployment or training with about 60%
OL,15,Fhaving never had a job, according to
OL,16,Fofficial figures.
OL,18,FThe Q3 Academy Langley, in Oldbury, is
OL,19,Famong a number of schools across the
OL,20,Fregion working with charity City Year
OL,21,FUK, which offers young adults mentoring
OL,22,Fopportunities in schools.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
