OL,3,GNEWSACharity calls for 'co-ordinated'
OL,4,Ahelp for young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teacher Peter Lee said the mentors
OL,7,Fwere an "integral part of our pastoral
OL,8,Ffunction" and "superb role models" for
OL,9,Fyoung people.
